  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your travel through the upper reaches of the forest at a rate of speed like traveling on the ground.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Acrobatics 5 ranks</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You can travel through the branches of trees in a forest or jungle and move at your base land speed or your base climb speed, whichever is faster. To do this, you must travel at least 20 feet above the ground. This ability will not work in light forests.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/jade-feats#toc75\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
